   ["Split on `Integrable f` for the positive-half-line measure instead of silently assuming compact support supplies measurability."
    "In the integrable branch, bound `t`, the exponential factor, and the derivative factor uniformly on the compact support."
    "Use local dominated differentiation at each complex parameter to obtain entire analyticity."
